  "notes": "FORMS:\n{先入|せんにゅう} (entering first) + {観|かん} (view) → view that enters first = preconception\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {先入観|せんにゅうかん}を{持|も}つ - to have preconceptions\n- {先入観|せんにゅうかん}を{捨|す}てる - to discard preconceptions\n- {先入観|せんにゅうかん}にとらわれる - to be bound by preconceptions\n- {先入観|せんにゅうかん}なしに - without preconceptions\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {偏見|へんけん} - prejudice, bias (more negative)\n- {固定観念|こていかんねん} - fixed idea, stereotype\n- {既成概念|きせいがいねん} - established concept",
